          },
          "description": "Most chocolate chip cookies are made with nine unassuming ingredients, and the recipe is easy enough that a child can bake a batch.  But everything that happens as those nine delicious ingredients blend chemically is nothing short of magic! In this bake-along book with photo illustrations, you’ll learn some fascinating cookie-baking science and some cool stories as you measure and add each ingredient to your mixing bowl. ",
